{
  "borough": "London Borough of Barking and Dagenham",
  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;1.&amp;nbsp;The proposed double-storey development, by reason of siting, scale, design, and bulk, would be a significant addition to the rear amenity area of the adjoining terrace row which would be at odds with the surrounding character of the area and streetscape pattern. The proposal will result in a disruption to the pattern of development, character of the surrounding plots, and built form of the area. The proposal will would be materially and detrimentally harmful to the appearance and character of the&amp;nbsp;surrounding area and sit at odds with the existing character.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;As such, the proposed development is contrary to:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span pt=&quot;&quot; sans=&quot;&quot;&gt;- National Planning Policy Framework &lt;/span&gt;National Planning Policy Framework (NPPF) (DLUHC, 2023)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span pt=&quot;&quot; sans=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;- Policy D4 of the London Plan (March 2021)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span pt=&quot;&quot; sans=&quot;&quot;&gt;- Policies SP2, DMD1 and DMD5&amp;nbsp;of &lt;/span&gt;The London Borough of Barking and Dagenham’s Local Plan: (September 2024)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;",
    "&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;2.&amp;nbsp;The addition of a two-storey dwelling, by reason of&amp;nbsp;scale, siting and design would result in significantly impacting adjoining sites and neighbouring dwellings which would result in creating a sense of overbearing, overshadowing, loss of outlook, loss of daylight and an increase in coming and goings, noise, activity and potential disturbances to the site. This will result in causing undue harm to adjoining and surrounding residents, as such, therefore constituting unneighbourly development and contrary to:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span pt=&quot;&quot; sans=&quot;&quot;&gt;- National Planning Policy Framework &lt;/span&gt;National Planning Policy Framework (NPPF) (DLUHC, 2023)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;- Policy D4 of the London Plan (March 2021);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span pt=&quot;&quot; sans=&quot;&quot;&gt;- Policies SP2, DMD1 and DMD5&amp;nbsp;of &lt;/span&gt;The London Borough of Barking and Dagenham’s Local Plan: (September, 2024)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br data-cke-eol=&quot;1&quot;&gt;"
  ],
